Initial commit: modpack-dl with Windows installer and CI

Downloads all mods of a Modrinth (.mrpack) or CurseForge (.zip) modpack.
Includes Inno Setup script and GitHub Actions workflow that builds the
exe (PyInstaller) and the installer on a Windows runner.

